<title>UK: UPS sets $200 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>UPS sets $200 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNITED PARCEL SERVICES</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    25.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.078   PAY DATE    25.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.678    SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
